torage (copy-on-write), so making it is O(1), and later changes to the original do not affect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the result. The cost comes later: while the result is alive, the next mutation of the original"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copies the whole graph, as it would with any other copy. Drop the result, or keep only what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you need from it ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Array(components)"},{"type":"text","text":"), before mutating the graph."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A component’s slice keeps the indices of the flat storage it is cut from, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CompressedSparseRow.successors(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" does: use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"first"},{"type":"text","text":", iteration or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Array(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because its type names the graph’s type, a result cannot be returned through an existential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"any DirectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": call it from a generic function (","type":"text"},{"code":"some DirectedGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/SK","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/Sl","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/SQ","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/Sk","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/ST"],"kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/doc